---
layout: base.njk
title: "Modules & Instruments"
description: "Physical models, 16-voice granular clouds, spectral morphing, formula melodies, and 36+ typed DSP modules in Perception Studio."
---

<section class="section grid-backdrop" style="border-top:0">
  <div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow"><a href="/learn/" style="text-decoration:none">← Learn</a> · Reference</p>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h1>Voices &amp; 36+ Signal Modules</h1>
      <p>
        Physical waveguides, modal bells, phase-distortion operators, granular clouds, and
        isolated VST3 plug-ins — all patchable in one typed graph.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter instruments by category">
      <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All instruments</button>
      <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="modular" aria-pressed="false">Modular</button>
      <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="physical" aria-pressed="false">Physical</button>
      <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="synth" aria-pressed="false">Synthesis</button>
      <button type="button" class="filter-btn" data-filter="percussion" aria-pressed="false">Percussion</button>
    </div>
    <p id="filter-status" class="mono dim" style="font-size:0.8rem; margin: -12px 0 18px;" aria-live="polite">
      Showing all {{ site.instruments.length }} instruments
    </p>

    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for inst in site.instruments %}
      <article class="card" data-category="{{ inst.category }}">
        <span class="card-tag{% if inst.category == 'physical' %} is-monitor{% elif inst.category == 'modular' %} is-mod{% endif %}">{{ inst.category }}</span>
        <h3 class="mono">{{ inst.kind }}</h3>
        <p>{{ inst.summary }}</p>
        <p class="mono" style="font-size:0.78rem; color: var(--ink);">{{ inst.controls }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Click any module for port &amp; DSP specs</h2>
      <p>Port rates, units, channel counts, and feedback cycles are checked on every cable.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="module-detail" aria-live="polite">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mono" id="module-detail-title">grainCloud</h3>
        <p id="module-detail-desc">Granular engine with 8–192 kHz WAV import, reverse/freeze playback rate, pan, and timing jitter.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="readout-pill" id="module-detail-rate">Stereo · 16 grains</span>
    </div>

    {% for group in site.moduleGroups %}
    <div class="module-group">
      <h3>
        <span class="dot dot-{{ group.accent }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        {{ group.name }}
      </h3>
      <div class="chip-list" role="group" aria-label="{{ group.name }}">
        {% for item in group.items %}
        <button
          type="button"
          class="chip{% if item == 'grainCloud' %} is-active{% endif %}"
          data-module="{{ item }}"
          aria-pressed="{% if item == 'grainCloud' %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
        >{{ item }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
